     3	Sol's #10 gate found three foundation cracks the panel silently rested on: seats.toml
     4	didn't parse (inline // comments), four seats had no family, and the roster named a seat
     5	that doesn't exist. These tests keep all three closed.
     6	"""
     7	
     8	import sys
     9	from pathlib import Path
    10	
    11	import pytest
    12	
